            Adapt the input to the surrounding form: <b>Underlined</b> replaces the box with a single
            underline, <b>HasBorder</b> removes the border altogether, <b>IconPosition</b> moves the calendar
            icon to the other side of the input, and <b>IconName</b> replaces it with any icon of the built-in
            Fluent UI set.
